      "question": "","proposition": {"type":"condition","label":"The alarm AL-44 (COMP FAULT) was triggered by the low-pressure input from P-R.","detail":"Passage p5 explicitly notes that evidence does not establish what specific equipment or process condition caused the indication at RHOB P-R, and passage p13 confirms entries do not identify the point of interruption. While passages support an alarm occurred (p2), they lack entailed cause attribution to 'low-pressure input from P-R' specifically versus other potential causes.","assessmentKind":"observation","sourceIds":["fcd254db-75b3-4a9d-abec-44c5b6a9b34e#1"],"claimIds":["claim-fhjudf"]}}
